      "utf8": "prestigious establishments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1381307,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But once the big banks stepped their game\nup, Amex quickly fell out of fashion as"
