    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so because they were subsidized\nby the big banks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1391275,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a result, merchants pushed back"
